# Workflow Architecture

## AI Sales Assistant Automation for a B2B Company

### Workflow

Google Forms
↓
Google Sheets
↓
AI by Zapier – B2B Lead Qualification
↓
Filter by Zapier – Qualified Leads
↓
Gmail – Sales Follow-up Email

### Purpose

This automation captures B2B leads, uses AI to evaluate and qualify them, filters qualified prospects, and automatically sends a personalized sales follow-up email.

### Tools Used

- Google Forms
- Google Sheets
- AI by Zapier
- Filter by Zapier
- Gmail
- CRM-ready lead data

### Business Value

- Reduces manual lead qualification
- Identifies qualified prospects faster
- Automates sales follow-up
- Improves lead management
- Saves time for sales teams# Workflow Architecture

